{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでもない日に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/01/09/3075362/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー世界中の人、みんな幸せにならないかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが最近の口癖。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくメンバーに【え？】と笑われますが。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、みーんな、幸せになったらいいのになって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが幸せだったらそれが私の幸せだから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは本当に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ってるだけじゃ変わらないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私に出来ることを頑張らないとね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来る限りの幸せを生み出そう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸に強く考える最近の口癖でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも正直"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"願いの規模が大きすぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何言ってんだって感じですよね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとか小さいことから頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"含め、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の目標は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【演技のお仕事をすること】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ランウェイ】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【かわいくなること】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【パフォーマンス能力とクオリティを上げること】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【皆さんの幸せを生み出すこと】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山だね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つでも叶うように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年までまた一年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援していてください。お願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰もがきっと【自分のこと】。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、皆さんはいつだって【私達のこと】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【応援してるよ。】【力になるよ。】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達のことばかり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな優しくて素敵な人なんてこの世界でみなさんだけですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会、プレゼント、お手紙、コメント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部大切な宝物です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵馬もちゃんと見ましたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣きそうになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いから、体には気をつけてくださいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/01/09/3075362/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わか。"}],"source":"archive"}